      "title": "13 \u00b7 Krea 2 depth",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 15 \u00b7 Mage Flow\n\nMicrosoft's Mage Flow, text-to-image. `mage-flow-turbo` is the distilled one and is what you want\nfor iteration: it renders 1024x1024 in about 4 seconds on an M5 Max at q8.\n\n**Aliases:** `mage-flow-turbo` (distilled, fast), `mage-flow` and `mage-flow-base` (CFG variants,\nslower, they do take `guidance` and a negative prompt).\n\n**Instruction edit:** switch the loader to `mage-flow-edit-turbo` and connect a photo through\n`mflux Image`. It takes several references like qwen-edit does, so chain more `mflux Image` nodes\nfor multi-reference edits.\n\n**Things that silently go wrong:**\n- On the turbo alias `steps` and `guidance` are preset-driven; leaving both at 0 is correct and the\n  sampler ignores overrides in `auto` mode.\n- The edit alias needs at least one image. Without one the sampler refuses the run rather than\n  quietly generating from the prompt alone."
      ],
      "color": "#2a363b",
      "bgcolor": "#1e2a30"
    },
